@startuml sick-leave-flow-uz
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
title Yozish tartibi: varaqani ochish, uzaytirish va yopish

participant "Kasallik varaqalari xizmati" as SVC #E8F0FE
participant "DHP FHIR serveri" as DHP #DCFCE7
participant "Iste'molchi" as C #FEF3C7

note over SVC, DHP : Patient, Practitioner va Organization DHP da allaqachon mavjud

== Ochish ==
SVC -> DHP : POST Condition (dastlabki, provisional)
SVC -> DHP : POST RelatedPerson, agar hujjatda bo'lsa
SVC -> DHP : POST CarePlan (opened, active)\nCondition va RelatedPerson ga havola qiladi
SVC -> DHP : POST Observation (CarePlan ga basedOn)

== Uzaytirish ==
SVC -> DHP : PUT CarePlan (extended, active)\nyangi incapacityPeriod va statusHistory yozuvi

== Yopish ==
SVC -> DHP : POST Condition (yakuniy, confirmed)
SVC -> DHP : PUT Condition (dastlabki): clinicalStatus resolved
SVC -> DHP : PUT CarePlan (closed, completed)\nikkala tashxisga havola qiladi

== O'qish ==
C -> DHP : GET CarePlan/{id}
DHP --> C : joriy versiya
C -> DHP : bog'liq Condition, Observation... ni o'qish

caption Resurs o'zi havola qiladigan resurslardan keyin yoziladi
@enduml
